        <mxCell id="QEsIJyCNk5LmVBJFXJcX-15" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;spacingTop=2;" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;CodeRegression.src.Operators - directory, where we have general functions to build methods (utils) and components to build algorithm pipelines (methods)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;•&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;CodeRegression.src.Operators.Utils - directory, where we have general functions that we use in multiple methods&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Utils.some_utility - classified general functions, for example to search for literals (public)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Methods - directory, where we have methods to construct custom pipelines from&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Methods.some_method - simply name of the method that implemented with various algorithms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 34);&quot;&gt;(public)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 34); background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;• CodeRegression.src.Operators.Methods.some_method.some_algo - simply implementation of the given method with specific algo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 34);&quot;&gt;We MUST guarantee that every algo takes and outputs the same set of params (public)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
